<sect1 id="UdpDelaySimRunner_8h_1DESCRIPTION">
<title>DESCRIPTION</title>
<para>The <ref refid="classUdpOutduct" kindref="compound">UdpOutduct</ref> class contains the functionality for a UDP outduct used by the <ref refid="classOutductManager" kindref="compound">OutductManager</ref>. This class is the interface to udp_lib. </para>
</sect1>
